WEBVTT

00:00:26.898 --> 00:00:31.736
Now, this taught me
an important lesson, firsthand.

00:00:31.778 --> 00:00:36.365
Namely, you can want to study
public policy or astrophysics,

00:00:36.407 --> 00:00:38.618
you can want to make a name for yourself,

00:00:38.659 --> 00:00:41.204
you can want to do an honest day’s work.

00:00:41.245 --> 00:00:43.956
But all of that
is extraordinarily difficult

00:00:43.998 --> 00:00:47.085
if your mind is thinking
about those unpaid bills.

00:00:47.085 --> 00:00:50.546
Or knowing, with the fullness
of your heart,

00:00:50.546 --> 00:00:52.215
that when you go to the cashpoint,

00:00:52.256 --> 00:00:54.634
it's going to respond
"Insufficient funds."

00:00:55.343 --> 00:00:57.720
Now, while I was going through all this --

00:00:57.762 --> 00:01:01.265
which, I have to say, happened
a little bit too long for my liking --